      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5927026418616636353\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA7A0.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🧠\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The 2026 International Olympiad in \u003cb\u003eArtificial Intelligence\u003c/b\u003e starts today. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAs a token of support for those who will reinvent our civilization, we\u0026#39;ll issue \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5409008750893734809\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F86.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏆\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003cb\u003e240\u003c/b\u003e exclusive \u003cb\u003eIntelligence Cups\u003c/b\u003e to the winners.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5409048419211682843\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F92B5.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💵\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We guarantee minimum buyback prices ($\u003cb\u003e1,000\u003c/b\u003e per \u003cb\u003eGold Cup\u003c/b\u003e, etc.), but the cups\u0026#39; limited supply may make them worth much more on the secondary market.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eGood luck, AI coders! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5406595657878220722\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8D80.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🍀\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
