      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5449829434334912605\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F87BAF09F87BF.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🇺🇿\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The 2026 International Olympiad in Informatics starts today in Tashkent.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5316979941181496594\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F86.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏆\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The \u003cb\u003eIOI\u003c/b\u003e is the ultimate coding competition for high-school students. Years ago, many members of the Telegram team won medals there. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5388584514953949249\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA49D.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤝\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e To support the best young programmers in the world, Telegram will award the \u003cb\u003e235\u003c/b\u003e winners exclusive digital collectibles — \u003cb\u003eAlgorithm Cups \u003c/b\u003e— worth at least \u003cb\u003e$117,000\u003c/b\u003e in total.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F958C.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🕌\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e It’s fitting that IOI is hosted in Uzbekistan — the homeland of Al-Khwarizmi, the father of algebra whose name became the word “algorithm.\u0026#34;\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eLet the best algorithm win! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5388755604976186348\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F92AA.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💪\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
